# Homepage lock

Do NOT change the first-page / homepage background until the user explicitly asks.

Keep: continuous dark `#040703` → `#0B100F` → `#142412` with soft upper-right green, faint square GRID LINES only (no intersection glow dots), mint stage outside the page, girl+ribbon as a cutout on that dark page (no green panel behind her).

Mint `#AAEEAE` / `#C3EBC6` is not the homepage fill.

# Sequence (use only when asked)

Hero → Mission (“solve/problems” green) → Selected Work → My Services → My Skills → Testimonials → Contact/MORE.

Green is an accent (Creative, ribbon, buttons, selected words). White is primary text. Black/deep green is 70–80% of the page.
